DATA / ATTRIBUTION NOTICE

The catalogue metadata generated and displayed by this project describes
third-party, openly licensed Android applications hosted on GitHub. The APKHub
project does NOT host, re-host, or redistribute any APK binary. Every download
link points to the original release asset published by its respective owner.

Each catalogue entry retains and displays:
  * the original repository owner and URL
  * the upstream license (when declared in the repository)
  * a direct link to the canonical release page

Respect the license of each upstream project. Where a project is NOT clearly
licensed, the entry is flagged accordingly and downloads remain at the user's
own discretion.
